1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:03,275
(Bernadette:)Howie, I don't want to play
Lego, Toenail or Pill anymore.

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,570
(Bernadette:)So, what do you think we
should do with this room?

3
00:00:07,576 --> 00:00:09,976
(Howard:)Well, I was thinking a
home theater or a gaming room...

4
00:00:09,979 --> 00:00:12,209
(Howard:)you know, like a man cave.

5
00:00:12,214 --> 00:00:13,684
(Bernadette:)Why can't it be a woman cave?

6
00:00:13,682 --> 00:00:15,712
(Howard:)As long as it has a home
theater, a video game system

7
00:00:15,718 --> 00:00:16,818
(Howard:)and you're not allowed in it,

8
00:00:16,819 --> 00:00:19,049
(Howard:)you can call it
whatever you want.

9
00:00:19,054 --> 00:00:21,054
(Bernadette:)I'm being serious.

10
00:00:21,056 --> 00:00:23,286
(Howard:)Well, what do you think
we should do?

11
00:00:23,292 --> 00:00:24,392
(Penny:)I don't know,

12
00:00:24,393 --> 00:00:26,863
(Bernadette:)maybe a home office or...

13
00:00:26,862 --> 00:00:28,332
(Sheldon:)Oh.

14
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,760
(Sheldon:)Look.

15
00:00:29,765 --> 00:00:32,695
(Bernadette:)The teddy bear Stuart won the
night we took him to the fair.

16
00:00:32,701 --> 00:00:33,901
(chuckles):
Oh.

17
00:00:34,803 --> 00:00:36,973
(Howard:)He was so excited.

18
00:00:36,972 --> 00:00:38,202
(Penny:)Yeah.

19
00:00:38,207 --> 00:00:39,977
(Bernadette:)You know, no matter
how hard they tried,

20
00:00:39,975 --> 00:00:42,705
(Bernadette:)they could not guess his age.

21
00:00:42,711 --> 00:00:45,411
(Howard:)I'll give it to him
next time I see him.

22
00:00:45,414 --> 00:00:47,084
(Bernadette:)Have you heard from him
since he left?

23
00:00:47,109 --> 00:00:48,299
(Amy(on Skype):)No.

24
00:00:48,484 --> 00:00:51,354
(Howard:)You'd think he would've called
once he got settled in.

25
00:00:51,353 --> 00:00:53,053
(Bernadette:)Hmm. Maybe he's busy.

26
00:00:53,055 --> 00:00:54,585
(Howard:)Too busy to call?
He wasn't too busy

27
00:00:54,590 --> 00:01:00,020
to binge-watch Hot in Cleveland
with my Hulu password.

